  "Local motion compares image samples; sound detection measures microphone level. Events go to your MQTT topic and event callback URL. This is not dog/person recognition.": "移动检测通过比较图像样本进行，声音检测通过测量麦克风音量进行。事件发送到 MQTT 主题及回调地址，不包含宠物或人像识别。",
